referent Component

relation build/imports
  reads {consumer: Component} imports {dependency: Component}
  subject consumer
  mode given consumer yields dependency: many

North ∈ Component
West ∈ Component
South ∈ Component
Core ∈ Component

North imports West
West imports Core

delta evolution/redirect-import
  withdraw
    North imports West
  admit
    South imports North

revision fixture/evolution-r1 from fixture/evolution-root
  apply evolution/redirect-import

revision fixture/evolution-r2 from fixture/evolution-r1
  admit
    South imports Core
